# Stale host build artifacts must not enter the container image.
#
# build/ holds a CMakeCache.txt baked with host absolute paths. Once `COPY . /src`
# drags it into the container, in-container CMake rejects it ("source does not
# match the one used to generate cache"), the agent build fails, and deploy.sh
# silently stages the pre-existing (stale) binaries as if it succeeded.
# Keep all build output, prior artifacts, and caches out of the context.
build/
dist/
.docker-cache/
.git/
